{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53443","headline":"送贾山人南游歌（幷序） · 柳宗元","name":"送贾山人南游歌（幷序）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"充乎其居，或以匮己之虚，（一作「或踬其涂，匮乎己之虚」。\n蜀本云：「或以」字下疑脱「两」字）。\n或盈其庐。\n孰匮孰充，爲泰爲穷，君子乌乎取以宁其躬！若君者之於道而已尔，世孰知其从容耶！（见《柳河东集》卷二五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"柳宗元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53443.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53443","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}